        'Select which administrators should also have the CB Operator role. Operators can generate reports, change branding, and manage this permissions page.' => 'Selecteer welke administrators ook de CB Operator-rol moeten hebben. Operators kunnen rapporten genereren, branding wijzigen, en deze permissions-pagina beheren.',
